        {
          "sender": "Sacko",
          "text": "Good morning @Brent Boone. We understand you don't care about the draft because you have 0 picks. But for the rest of us it will be helpful to understand the exact picks every has. Especially if we are trying to make trades. It's a dynasty league, pretty important.  So if you can go in an edit the draft order today that would be appreciated. I'll even do the work for you, using reverse max pf + playoff finish:\n1.1 chudders\n1.2 oscar\n1.3 burger\n1.4 harlow\n1.5 kevo\n1.6 karim\n1.7 Brent\n1.8 pat\n1.9 blake\n1.10 me\n1.11 Zach\n1.12 Ben\nNot everyone has all their picks so this isn't the order. But once Brent does his job (he works for us) then we can have a better picture of all rounds in the draft.",
          "timestamp_local": "2025-03-05T07:35:39-08:00"
        },
        {
          "sender": "Brent Boone",
          "text": "The above message by Nate is what employees who are ineffective at using their time do. I’m currently in Berlin trying to grow my business @nate so calm the fuck down. If you weren’t short on brain cells you would be able to find a doc you’ve asked to be shared on at least 3 times. In this doc you would see the vote passed to draft after week 3 of the preseason. Which means after the nfl draft. A) there’s plenty of time b) your research prior to knowing what team a players goes to is relatively moot.",
          "timestamp_local": "2025-03-05T07:51:48-08:00"
        }
      ],
